 "_changes": "v3: new card, nothing reused from v2 (rejected in game as static). r1 (2026-11-14, offline, owner notes round 1): f6-f12 contact is a diagonal 40 deg right of +Y (shoulder line on the same line, hand 30 cm outside the right shoulder seen from behind), legs long f5-f12 (pelvis 0..+0.5 cm, knees <= 23), hold drifts 4.5 cm (rise, chin up, arm back to the line), new key f1 at 45% of the coil, f2 chest at 68% of the chamber, f4 hand 3.5 cm off spine_05 (offline), left heel no longer rises (planted exemption removed). Backup: overlord_jab1_v3.r0.backup.json.",
